---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
 title="Privacy Policy | China Layover Guide"
  description="How China Layover Guide handles your data."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-[46rem] px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>This is a static, informational website. We do not require accounts or collect personal data.</p>
    <h2>What we don&rsquo;t collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No accounts, no logins, no user-generated content.</li>
      <li>No display advertising networks or personal data collection by us.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Affiliate links and partner scripts</h2>
    <p>
      Some pages include travel affiliate links (such as hotels, tours, or eSIM providers) managed
      through Travelpayouts and partner networks. Clicking an affiliate link or loading our partner
      referral script may allow those third-party partners to set a referral cookie so a booking can
      be attributed to this site. We do not receive your personal or payment details from those
      partners.
    </p>
    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      Pages link to official sources, map services, and payment providers. Those sites have their
      own privacy policies.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to the site owner.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
